<HEAD>PART 2201&#x2014;REGULATIONS IMPLEMENTING THE FREEDOM OF INFORMATION ACT
</HEAD>
<AUTH>
<HED>Authority:</HED><PSPACE>29 U.S.C. 661(g); 5 U.S.C. 552.
</PSPACE></AUTH>
